# M-package-manager step 5b (the coordinator's ruling of 2026-11-08): the
# entry's `git` names `file://./linked/yaml`, and `linked` is a symbolic link
# (made in the case's copy, `links`), which could name a place outside the
# program's repository, so `heroes fetch` refuses the source. The build tells
# the verb's refusal, where it said *not placed: `heroes fetch` places it*.
use <yaml>/load  #~ source_refused

function main()
    print(load.size())
